From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:13:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] wave: expose additional radio and transport observations

Rebased from 77a61eec2dd8950238a0d3493febde8b0bb00af2 onto the reduced
core. Retain watchdog reply age, MHI layout and IRQ/EAPOL/SID traces.
All observed code owners remain in core; no optional data-path feature is
restored. These observations do not implement firmware capabilities.

Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

